  "description": "NIQTIQ crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C84 H122 Eu4 N6 O8. From the CIF bond table, Eu1 (Eu) has 4 O neighbors; Eu2 (Eu) has 4 O neighbors; Eu3 (Eu) has 4 O neighbors; Eu4 (Eu) has 4 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.763-3.937 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 97.41-104.42°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C84H122Eu4N6O8.",
